WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
Chūka Ichiban

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.110
The biggest event in the Spring Festival

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:38.600
is Guangzhou Dumpling Competition.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:41.530
Due to Chef Zhou Yu's sudden injury,

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:42.740
I was appointed to join the competition

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:44.220
on behalf of Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:46.690
Though I was framed by the rivals,

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.930
luckily,

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.080
I got help from Master Lang Wen

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:54.420
and finally caught up with the Dumpling Brothers.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.700
So, we're even,

00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:57.560
the first time in the history of the competition.

00:01:58.140 --> 00:01:58.930
But

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.690
you'll have to compete again tomorrow.

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:04.470
OK, I agree.

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:06.060
Me too.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:08.480
In this way,

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.380
we decided to

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.410
have a showdown

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:13.590
with the Dumpling Brothers.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.500
Confrontation, Dragon Dumplings

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:40.670
Brother is as good as a super chef,

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.770
but has been suffering

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.610
as a Stray Cook.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.190
Anyway,

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.320
I'll help him succeed

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.230
this time.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.630
This is what the guy prepared.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:01.900
Just like yesterday,

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.090
only a little more salt

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:04.430
will make him

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:05.830
lose tomorrow.

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:12.230
Darn it.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:13.740
Who is there?

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:21.620
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:25.440
Are you qualified to be a chef?

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.900
You don't have to tell me that.

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:28.990
The winner takes it all.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.420
That's what my brother always said to me.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.640
Even with dirty means?

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:34.810
Shut up!

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:36.430
Don't think you're superior

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:37.610
because you're from Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.520
How could you

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:40.680
understand my brother's feelings?

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:43.930
Those stupid clients

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:47.930
only know reputation and brand.

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.490
In such a context,

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.340
how could you know
what my brother has suffered?

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:01.910
So this time,

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:03.400
it's your turn

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.450
to get famous, right?

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.560
Don't be so naive.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.530
As chefs,

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:11.910
we have our own dignity,

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:14.210
besides carrying on our brands.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.960
Young as he is,

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.680
Liu Maoxing worked hard

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.330
to defend his dignity.

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:25.950
If your brother abandons his dignity

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.800
to win,

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.320
then he is not qualified to be a chef.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:31.810
What did you say?

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:33.620
My brother can't be wrong.

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.270
Darn it. Don't go too far.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.060
Damn it.

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:43.660
It is still dark.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.670
I'll get some more sleep.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:51.890
It hurts.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.040
It hurts.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:54.520
Go and wash your face.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:55.680
Time to get ready for practice.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:57.320
Yes.

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:59.530
I'm looking forward to your dumplings.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.470
OK. I'll try my best.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:05.680
(South Guangzhou Hotel)

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:20.320
Takeo.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:22.600
Aru,

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.440
I haven't been so excited in a long time.

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:25.880
It has been years!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.260
I haven't seen you cook for a long time.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:29.850
We have been busy

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.220
rebuilding our restaurant.

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:33.320
I always thought

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:34.320
I've already become

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:35.720
an empty-shell person.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:37.030
But now

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.700
I get my passion back.

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:43.280
Seeing

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.530
the little guy,

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:46.460
I've no idea

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:48.300
why I became excited again.

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:49.350
Takeo.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:50.870
I'm going to defeat him.

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.690
I'll bet my dignity as a chef.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:56.020
As long as you do it,

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.650
no one can match you.

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:00.740
This time,

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:01.710
I'll defeat

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:02.750
Yang Spring Restaurant

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.400
with my unmatchable shrimp dumplings

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:10.870
The Dragon Dumplings.

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.350
The new year brings luck.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:19.470
The dumpling competition incredibly lasts two days.

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:21.780
The Dumpling Brothers are amazing,

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:23.210
but the little guy from Yang Spring Restaurant

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:23.920
is quite something.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.400
I'm curious about

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:26.790
what dumplings

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:27.920
they will make.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:28.980
Here you are!

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.620
What are these balls for?

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:32.580
Here you are.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:35.810
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.690
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.210
At this dumpling competition,

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.890
we have an unprecedented result.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.470
Yang Spring Restaurant and Dumpling brothers

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:45.020
broke even.

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:45.980
We'll hold another match

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.220
to select the winner.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:52.450
All of you will be served

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:55.230
dumplings with the two teams.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.400
Then put

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:57.860
one of the two balls

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.300
in this large jar.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.930
The red ball represents the Dumpling Brothers.

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.380
The white represents Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:06.860
Everyone,

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:08.220
please vote for your favorite.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:12.810
OK. Let's welcome the two teams.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.200
The competition will end at noon,

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:16.820
please stop then.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.430
Aru, are you ready?

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:32.610
Look! So many shrimps.

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:44.480
Following the Fire Dumpling,

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.820
what will they do?

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:47.630
Aru, bring me red peppers.

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:51.990
Awesome!

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:53.410
Amazing skills.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:54.890
So handsome.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.730
Takeo, you're so handsome.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.900
Quite nice cutting skills.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.510
He is not inferior to Chef Zhou Yu.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:04.970
What do you say?

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.850
You have nothing to say now,

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:07.790
Chef Zhou Yu?

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.250
(Yang Spring Restaurant)
More fire.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:15.750
(Yang Spring Restaurant)
Bring me a plate.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.670
It's starting.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:25.810
OK.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.080
It's almost noon.

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:29.190
Please hurry up.

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:31.090
Mao, is this right?

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:32.990
Use two dumpling wrappers.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:34.710
Make as many as you can.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.470
Two dumpling wrappers!

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:37.050
Come on.

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.150
Yes, time is running out.

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:42.730
Time's up.

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:45.660
Thank you for waiting.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.050
Let's start from

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:49.070
the Dumpling Brothers’.

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:50.950
Yesterday, their Fire Dumpling

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.760
surprised all of us.

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.020
What about today?

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.010
I can't wait to have a try.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:56.930
Come on, everyone.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.430
Thanks for waiting.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.310
Here is

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.290
the Dragon Dumpling.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.040
A dragon roaming in the sea.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.830
It's exactly the dragon dumpling.

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:22.470
Dragon.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:28.920
The dumplings are made of

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:30.560
Guangdong's rice flour.

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:32.950
After being steamed, wrappers become transparent.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.340
Everything inside can be seen.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.260
The red scale is...

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.490
Right, it's the red pepper.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:40.970
The corrugated edges of the two wrappers

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:42.900
are the dorsal fins.

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:46.210
Then the shrimp heads are used as

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:47.840
dragon beards and horns.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.180
It is so vivid.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:53.050
They made the Dragon Dumpling
following the Fire Dumpling.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.610
Dumpling Brothers are really something.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:01.990
It tastes great, too.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.710
As to the taste,

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:08.040
the shrimp fillings

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:10.500
are just right.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:12.790
It's chewy while biting it.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:13.860
It's fantastic.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:14.640
One more, please.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:15.630
Yes.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.160
You're awesome, guys.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.730
It's really unmatchable dragon dumplings.

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.100
Thank you very much.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.070
What do you say, little guy?

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.100
OK, next is Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.230
13-year-old Liu Maoxing,

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.890
on behalf of Yang Spring Restaurant,

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.070
participated in the competition

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:38.950
and evened the score

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:40.390
miraculously.

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:42.990
What about his dumplings?

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:55.480
What happened?

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:04.950
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.010
How could this be?

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:11.200
He also made

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:12.760
the Dragon Dumpling.

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:14.740
Though it's a good idea,

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.890
following the Dumpling Brothers',

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:17.820
it won't be good.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.360
It's also the Dragon Dumpling,

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:21.730
but it seems not as better as Takeo's.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:22.780
Right.

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:25.200
Takeo's dumplings

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:26.670
are much better.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.150
That's not good.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:30.090
The same dumplings.

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.330
In terms of skills,

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.600
they're way ahead of us.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:34.000
Mao.

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.110
The game is set.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:40.670
He's just a little kid after all.

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.180
Takeo's dumpling is

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:45.030
a dragon roaming in the sea,

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:45.750
while Mao's

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.100
is a sleeping dragon.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:48.850
That's a good point.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.280
Everyone, attention!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.400
My dragon is about to

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:55.200
wake up.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:03.060
What is it?

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:04.140
What are you doing?

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:05.100
Nothing can be seen.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:18.890
It's moving.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:19.700
What happened?

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:30.110
What?

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:51.470
It's moving.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.410
The Dragon Dumpling is standing up.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:55.310
What's the matter?

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:56.220
Takeo.

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:57.310
It's impossible.

00:12:57.430 --> 00:12:58.720
How could a dumpling move?

00:12:59.130 --> 00:12:59.730
Everyone,

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:02.120
this is my Rising Dragon Dumpling.

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:03.740
Rising Dragon Dumping.

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:05.380
It's moving indeed.

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:06.940
Yes.

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:09.080
Dumplings could move, seriously?

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:10.180
How did you do it?

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:12.970
Tell us.

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.290
Please have a taste first.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:16.840
Enjoy.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:17.870
How did you do it?

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:19.540
Tell me, please.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.210
That's hot.

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:24.850
I'll tell you later. Enjoy, please.

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:26.580
OK.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:41.270
(Delicious)

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:44.070
The taste is wonderful.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:45.170
So delicious.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:48.040
Great!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.830
It's unspeakably delicious.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:53.160
Seems it's more than shrimp meat.

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:54.840
I've no idea which one is better.

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:57.890
This time,

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:58.960
the two teams are both excellent.

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:00.450
I see.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:02.490
It's pretty tasty.

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:05.580
Yummy, really terrific.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:09.010
That's what it is.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.670
No wonder it could move.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.200
Well, everyone.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.500
Please cast your votes.

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.020
The red ball is for the Dumpling Brothers

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:21.250
and the white ball for Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:23.610
Please put your ball in the jar.

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:36.870
Mao's dumplings are also delicious.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.660
But Takeo's are not bad.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:49.200
Mao.

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.640
Relax. We've done our best.

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:52.630
Takeo.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.130
Don't worry.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.300
Our dumplings are matchless.

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:57.870
OK.

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:59.280
Our champion this year

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.590
is about to be named.

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.000
This competition

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:03.500
can be treated as two dragon's duel.

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.640
Which one will win?

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:07.330
The roaming dragon

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:08.260
or

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.920
the rising dragon?

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.240
The answer will be revealed soon.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:14.230
Red or white?

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:18.320
The jar will tell us.

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:44.710
White balls.

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:45.940
All of them are white balls.

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:48.270
Not a single red ball.

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:50.360
The winner is Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:51.750
We made it. Great.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:54.410
In this year's Dumpling Competition,

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:56.070
Yang Spring Restaurant,

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:57.490
the first famous Guangzhou food restaurant,

00:15:57.710 --> 00:15:59.670
won the top prize.

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.990
What a rising dragon.

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:04.630
Mao, you're awesome.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.960
We finally get revenge for our defeat last year.

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:08.830
Great, Mao.

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:11.780
How is it possible?

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:15.740
Hold on,

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.920
I don't accept.

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:21.940
What's the big deal about moving dumplings?

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.310
How could my brother's dumplings

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.400
be defeated by

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:27.810
the kid's?

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:28.930
Dumpling Brothers,

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.460
you're so narrow-minded.

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:32.590
Yes.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:33.720
Elder Guan

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:35.640
Attention!

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:37.700
Let's do a fair analysis

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:39.620
on the two teams' dumplings.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.840
First, the cooking shall render a visual effect.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.410
In this aspect,

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:52.070
Takeo's knife skills

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:53.980
are superb for its shaping of the dragon.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:56.020
It is indeed excellent.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.860
But the most notable is

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.340
that Mao's dragon

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:02.340
is so vivid

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:03.540
and creative.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:06.120
Mao,

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:08.320
tell us how you made it.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:10.710
I'm sure that everyone wants to know.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:11.820
Yes.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:12.980
Tell us, please.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:14.160
How could it move?

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.540
My secret is that

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:16.760
I used two different kinds of wrappers.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.540
Two kinds of wrappers.

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:21.160
(Illustration of Cooking)

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.960
The dumplings

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:25.570
are made of

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:27.330
two kinds of wrappers.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.860
After being steamed,

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.350
being steamed...

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:34.220
It's weird.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:37.420
They're going to expand differently.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:38.240
That's right.

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:40.320
Different expansion.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.870
The lower one will be slightly larger.

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.050
So the dragon can move.

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:46.100
I see.

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:48.020
What a brilliant idea.

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.520
You're joking.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.210
Even your dumplings can move.

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:54.080
It has nothing to do with the taste.

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:54.960
You're wrong.

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:56.600
In fact, it matters.

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:57.550
What does it matter?

00:17:58.440 --> 00:17:59.700
As it swells,

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:01.230
the fillings-wrapper space

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:02.840
will be filled up.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.480
The flavor of shrimps

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:05.630
will be kept inside.

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:08.370
The shape is also improved.

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:09.760
What shape?

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:11.480
It's the basic requirement

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:12.580
for dumplings.

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:14.660
How is yours different from ours?

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:16.460
Our shape is not bad, either.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.200
Our shrimps are also delicious.

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:28.570
How could it be?

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.320
Takeo, what's up?

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:33.730
Aru, we lost.

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:36.230
Seems he got it.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:38.500
Look at it.

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:40.260
This is...

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:41.550
Shrimp brain.

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:44.890
The shrimp brain has been taken out.

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:47.620
Mao put it in the fillings.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.300
Upon being steamed,

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:50.870
the taste of shrimps

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:52.530
is everywhere

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:53.880
inside the dumplings.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.970
That's why my Dragon Dumplings

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:59.070
can't beat

00:18:59.120 --> 00:18:59.830
the Rising Dragon Dumpling.

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:03.730
Takeo.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.130
Your dumplings

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.070
need the finishing touch.

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:10.630
Master Lang Wen.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:11.350
To be honest,

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.770
your craft is by no means

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:14.220
inferior to Mao's.

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.190
The key to success

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:19.740
cannot only depend on plans

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.340
but the chef's care to clients.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:23.430
This is

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:26.060
the starting point to be a chef.

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:27.710
Dumpling Brothers,

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:29.030
what you need

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:31.310
is exactly a chef's care to clients.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:35.850
I believe as long as you know it,

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:37.980
you'll be a good chef.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.270
You can do it!

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:43.570
Master Lang Wen.

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:46.280
I lost.

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:50.130
I lost fair and square.

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:55.500
Mao.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:02.570
What do you want?

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:05.610
Please remember him.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.080
the winner of

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:08.950
Guangzhou

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.100
Dumpling Competition,

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:11.590
Liu Maoxing.

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:23.760
Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:25.900
Well done! Mao.

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:28.750
You're making a progress

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:30.290
faster than I thought.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:33.170
I think the time has come.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:34.070
What time?

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:34.810
Mao,

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:36.690
I have an idea.

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.590
Hope you can challenge

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:40.400
the Super Chef Test in Guangzhou.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:42.550
Super Chef Test?

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.540
Mao's going to join the Super Chef Test?

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.510
And at the place with the most rigorous test.

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:47.760
Will it be Guangzhou?

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.190
Besides your mother, Chef Pai

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:51.420
and several Sichuan chefs,

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:53.160
plus Guangzhou chefs,

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:55.300
Chef Ruoh and Chef Zhou Yu,

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:57.220
only a dozen chefs

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:59.600
have the highest honor,

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.470
the Super Chef.

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:04.110
It will

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:05.760
probably be

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:07.300
your future goal.

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:09.820
Do you want to

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:10.920
have a try?

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:11.950
Don't worry. Mao.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.730
I'll help you.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.360
Master Lang Wen.

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.370
Mao, just try it.

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:19.700
Take a shot.

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:21.720
Right. Mao, just try it.

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:24.050
Let's cheer for Mao.

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:27.940
Come on! Mao.

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:38.000
Yes, Provincial Military Commander Li,

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.670
I decide to challenge the Super Chef Test.

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:18.360
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:21.649
All right, finally it's time to
challenge the Super Chef Test.

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:24.400
But when I looked around,
all I saw were people who looked amazing.

00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:28.323
Wow, is that monster with
the nunchaku knife also a chef?

00:23:28.490 --> 00:23:30.241
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.266 --> 00:23:33.320
Challenge the Dream! Super Chef Test

00:23:33.494 --> 00:23:34.871
It will definitely be interesting!
